# RaidBossType5 (25109), level 1 like the level 1 character, is hit for 22. RaidBossStandard
# wants to attack the character at 22 / (1 + 7) * 20000; the hit, one on its party too, then
# reaches the party-attacked hook. The character holds none of its ranged hold (RANGE_HOLD_A,
# 4197): on a draw of 0 in 150 it wants the hold on the character at 1000000. Seeing the
# character cast Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster beside it, on another draw of 0 it wants
# the hold again, adding 1000000. A hit on a private, and the hold's effect closing both, are
# in tests/ai/raid_boss7_test.go: the format places no template privates and lands no effect
# on the character. The character's combat draws are pinned so the debuff lands.
character Hunter 1
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossParty
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossType5
npc boss 25109 RaidBoss 250 0 0 skill RANGE_HOLD_A 4197 7
npc wolf 20120 Monster 150 0 0

hit boss 22
  desires boss attack(player)=55000 cast(player,4197,move)=1000000
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires boss attack(player)=55000 cast(player,4197,move)=2000000
